            "answer": "<ul><li><strong>Wrong size?</strong> We’ll swap it. Exchange unworn pairs within 30 days.</li><li><strong>Change of mind:</strong> unworn, unwashed pairs in original packaging can be returned within 30 days for a refund or store credit</li><li><strong>Faulty or damaged:</strong> let us know and we’ll replace or refund it, no questions asked</li><li>For hygiene reasons, we can’t accept worn or washed socks</li><li>To start a return or exchange, <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\"><strong>contact us</strong></a> with your order number</li></ul>"
