          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes Pearler different from any other sock?",
            "answer": "<p>Every other sock is made to fit a range of feet. Ours are made to fit yours.</p><ul><li><strong>Exact sizing:</strong> every sock is knitted to one shoe size, not a range like 8-11</li><li><strong>Three thicknesses:</strong> Feather, Core and Cloud, matched to your shoes and your day</li><li><strong>Built-in ventilation:</strong> knitted channels keep air moving, even under leather shoes</li><li><strong>3 years and 56 samples</strong> to get it right</li></ul>"
          }
        },
