          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the difference between Feather, Core and Cloud? ",
            "answer": "<p>It’s all about thickness. Pick the one that suits your shoes and your day.</p><ul><li><strong>Feather:</strong> thin and sleek, for dress shoes, loafers and the office</li><li><strong>Core:</strong> our everyday sock, for sneakers and most days</li><li><strong>Cloud:</strong> extra cushioning, for long days on your feet or when comfort comes first</li></ul><p>Can’t decide? The <a href=\"/products/pearler-discovery-box\" title=\"Pearler Discovery Box Womens\"><strong>Discovery Box</strong></a> gives you one of each.</p>"
