          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know which size to order?",
            "answer": "<p>Order your shoe size. Each Pearler sock is knitted to one exact size, so the shoe size you wear is the sock size you get.</p><ul><li><strong>Women’s:</strong> US 6, 7, 8, 9 and 10, each made to that exact size</li><li><strong>Men’s:</strong> US 8, 9, 10, 11, 12 and 13, each made to that exact size</li><li><strong>Half size or between sizes?</strong> Size down</li><li><strong>Not sure on thickness or length?</strong> Take the <a href=\"/pages/quiz\" title=\"Quiz\">Quiz</a>. It takes under a minute.</li><li><strong>Still not right?</strong> We’ll swap it within 30 days.</li></ul>"
