            "answer": "<p>That’s exactly the problem we started Pearler to fix. Shared socks stretch to fit the bigger foot, then fit nobody properly.</p><ul><li><strong>Each of you gets your own exact size</strong></li><li><strong>Your size is knitted on the sole</strong> (M11, W8), so no more mix-ups in the wash</li><li><strong>Mix men’s and women’s in one order:</strong> every pair counts toward your set pricing</li></ul>"
